### ==============================================================================
### Bright Mind Ltd - Smart Task & Project Management System
### Phase 4: Authentication & Authorization Test Suite (VS Code REST Client / Postman)
### Base URL: http://localhost:5000/api/auth
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/auth
@demoToken = {{loginSuccess.response.body.data.token}}

### 1. Test Server Root & Health Check
GET http://localhost:5000/api/health
Content-Type: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### REGISTRATION TESTS
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2. Register New User (Expect: 201 Created with safe user object and JWT token)
# @name registerSuccess
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tanvir Hasan",
  "email": "tanvir.hasan@brightmind.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 3. Register Duplicate Email (Expect: 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tanvir Hasan Clone",
  "email": "tanvir.hasan@brightmind.com",
  "password": "AnotherPassword123!"
}

### 4. Register Validation Error - Short Password (Expect: 400 Bad Request with field errors)
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Invalid User",
  "email": "invalid@brightmind.com",
  "password": "123"
}

### 5. Register Validation Error - Invalid Email (Expect: 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Invalid Email User",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### LOGIN TESTS
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 6. Login Success with Valid Seed User (Expect: 200 OK with token)
# @name loginSuccess
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@brightmind.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 7. Login with Invalid Password (Expect: 401 Unauthorized)
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@brightmind.com",
  "password": "wrong_password_here"
}

### 8. Login with Non-Existent Email (Expect: 401 Unauthorized)
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nonexistent@brightmind.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### PROTECTED ROUTE TESTS (/api/auth/me)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 9. Get Authenticated User Profile with Valid Bearer Token (Expect: 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{demoToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 10. Access Protected Endpoint Without Token (Expect: 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Content-Type: application/json

### 11. Access Protected Endpoint With Malformed / Invalid Token (Expect: 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer invalid_jwt_token_string_12345
Content-Type: application/json
